    "title": "Douglas Education Service District Receives $10,000 Oregon Community Foundation Grant - NewsBreak",
    "text": "21 hours ago Douglas Education Service District is among the Southern Oregon organizations receiving support through the Oregon Community Foundation’s 2026 Walker Fund grants. The Roseburg-based district will receive $10,000 to help provide evening and weekend family events for Early Intervention and Early Childhood Special Education families. The goal is to make it easier for families to take part in events outside of the traditional workday. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
